        "problem": "Express $2{cos}^{2}\u2061{33}^{\u2218}-1$ as a single trigonometric ratio.",
        "worked_solution": "First, let's recall the double-angle formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n2{cos}^{2}\u2061x-1=\\operatorname{cos}\u20612x\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x={33}^{\u2218}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2{cos}^{2}\u2061{33}^{\u2218}-1 & =\\operatorname{cos}\u2061(2\\cdot {33}^{\u2218}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}\u2061{66}^{\u2218}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
